:"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:769649858e9bcee201e86c206bb294f7c59248807625067c1ea32384fc527bc1","file":"preprints/Generalized-ionization-energies-for-full-Coulomb-atoms-September-24-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex","line":78,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"55209529455bc1fac73d7904ece1d4d31bc864ba9f049002fed114c1d7ea7d5c","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Generalized-ionization-energies-for-full-Coulomb-atoms-September-24-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:769649858e9bcee201e86c206bb294f7c59248807625067c1ea32384fc527bc1","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Generalized-ionization-energies-for-full-Coulomb-atoms-September-24-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex#L78"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nFor full nonrelativistic Coulomb atoms with two electron spin states,\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:joint-limit}\n \\frac{I_m(Z)}{m^{7/3}}\\longrightarrow a_{\\TF}>0\n \\quad\\text{whenever}\\quad m\\longrightarrow\\infty,\n \\qquad \\frac Zm\\longrightarrow\\infty,\n\\end{equation}\nwhere $Z>m\\ge1$ are integers. In particular,\n\\begin{align}\n \\lim_{m\\to\\infty}\n  \\frac{\\limsup_{Z\\to\\infty} I_m(Z)}{m^{7/3}}\n   &=a_{\\TF},\\label{eq:iterated-upper}\\\\\n \\lim_{m\\to\\infty}\n  \\frac{\\liminf_{Z\\to\\infty} I_m(Z)}{m^{7/3}}\n   &=a_{\\TF}.\\label{eq:iterated-lower}\n\\end{align}\nThe inner limits are taken over integer $Z$ with $m$ fixed. No convergence\nof $I_m(Z)$ at a fixed $m$ is asserted or assumed."}
